  "title": "Playboy to Host Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Earnings Call on March 16, 2026 at 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, March 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Playboy, Inc. (Nasdaq: PLBY) (“Playboy” or the “Company”), a global pleasure and leisure company, will release financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2025 after Nasdaq closes on Monday, March 16, 2026.",
